WEBVTT

01:56.160 --> 01:57.240
One year,

01:57.960 --> 01:59.880
I had the hallway renovated.

02:01.080 --> 02:02.640
I hired a relative to take the job.

02:04.080 --> 02:08.000
Turns out there were quality issues.

02:08.080 --> 02:11.840
One resident slipped
on the stairs at night and died.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.080
I figured

02:14.160 --> 02:17.280
I should fix it before it got worse,
so I redid the hallway.

02:17.880 --> 02:19.000
But I had no money left.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.160
So I secretly

02:21.960 --> 02:25.440
took materials from maintenance
and got some supplies.

02:25.520 --> 02:26.920
I set up a small shack

02:27.000 --> 02:28.600
in the parking garage
and stashed the materials there.

02:32.440 --> 02:33.280
Officer Ran,

02:35.040 --> 02:37.440
why did you go to the garage?

02:38.840 --> 02:40.920
I just thought, once I had enough,

02:41.000 --> 02:43.000
I'd fix it properly.

02:43.080 --> 02:46.120
You tell me, why'd he get so much cement?

02:47.560 --> 02:49.640
This cement must be about 100 kilos.

02:51.080 --> 02:52.120
But then,

02:54.640 --> 02:55.480
that year,

02:55.560 --> 02:57.960
Ju… July…

03:13.400 --> 03:15.440
Rats. I love catching rats.

03:15.520 --> 03:17.480
Xiaohe, slow down.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.400
Xiaohe.

03:19.920 --> 03:23.680
Uncle Ran, this underground maze
is so cool!

03:23.760 --> 03:24.800
Xiaohe,

03:26.640 --> 03:28.320
stay close to me.

03:28.400 --> 03:30.000
What if a rat suddenly jumps out?

03:50.640 --> 03:52.440
How would I know

03:52.520 --> 03:57.280
there was a head and two arms
in that tool bag?

03:59.720 --> 04:01.920
I did think about calling the police.

04:02.000 --> 04:02.960
Did you?

04:27.240 --> 04:29.200
-Who is it?
-Qian Dajun.

04:29.280 --> 04:30.800
You brat!

04:32.120 --> 04:33.440
Dad.

04:33.520 --> 04:35.000
Who are you calling Dad?

04:35.080 --> 04:37.480
When are you going to sell
the place in Yuanlongli?

04:38.000 --> 04:39.000
Soon.

04:39.640 --> 04:41.400
-Soon.
-Not a chance.

04:41.480 --> 04:42.840
I've heard about it!

04:42.920 --> 04:44.360
They say that place eats people.

04:44.440 --> 04:46.480
No one dares live there.
Prices are dropping like crazy.

04:46.560 --> 04:47.520
Back then,

04:47.600 --> 04:50.240
rumors were going around
that the place was killing people.

04:50.760 --> 04:52.400
If I'd called the police,

04:52.480 --> 04:56.720
neither my place nor my relatives'
would've sold.

04:57.240 --> 04:59.200
After thinking it through,

04:59.280 --> 05:02.440
I decided to keep it quiet.

05:05.120 --> 05:08.360
I figured I'd find a safer place,

05:08.440 --> 05:10.560
hide it first,

05:10.640 --> 05:13.160
then deal with it when I got the chance.

05:15.760 --> 05:16.880
Careful, Xiaohe.

05:22.120 --> 05:24.120
I put it in the chicken coop.

05:25.320 --> 05:27.240
I was afraid my uncle would find it.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.560
So I thought

05:28.640 --> 05:31.400
I should move it to a safer place.

05:32.840 --> 05:35.760
But that drain inlet was too small.

05:37.560 --> 05:39.600
No matter what, it wouldn't fit.

05:39.680 --> 05:42.680
So I had to move it again.

05:51.560 --> 05:54.760
When I came back,
I found the head was gone.

05:54.840 --> 05:56.600
I couldn't find it anywhere.

05:57.520 --> 05:58.920
So I took the bag

05:59.000 --> 06:01.360
and buried it
in the woods behind the complex.

06:01.880 --> 06:05.480
I was terrified for a long time,

06:05.560 --> 06:07.920
having nightmares every day.

06:09.040 --> 06:11.800
I went on like that for five years.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.400
I thought it was over,

06:14.480 --> 06:15.840
but then,

06:17.760 --> 06:19.120
in the summer of 2002,

06:19.200 --> 06:22.960
my uncle, Ge Jingsong,
pulled the head out.

06:23.040 --> 06:25.200
Murder!

06:44.080 --> 06:45.600
Officer Ran went like a man possessed,

06:46.520 --> 06:49.720
tearing through the whole complex,
searching everywhere.

06:49.800 --> 06:50.640
DANGER, ELECTRICITY

06:55.800 --> 06:57.920
I was guilty and scared,

06:58.560 --> 07:00.720
so I dug the bag back up

07:01.360 --> 07:02.200
and moved it.

07:02.280 --> 07:04.120
SO I MOVED THE BAG

07:04.200 --> 07:07.360
But later, I almost got caught
by Officer Ran.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.240
Open it.

07:17.960 --> 07:18.960
At that time,

07:19.040 --> 07:21.760
the underground garage
was under construction.

07:21.840 --> 07:23.480
I took advantage of the moment

07:24.240 --> 07:26.960
and stuffed the arm bones into the cement

07:27.040 --> 07:28.680
and made a cement block.

07:29.200 --> 07:31.840
I thought this time, no one would find it.

07:32.520 --> 07:34.200
But I didn't expect,

07:34.280 --> 07:36.480
after more than ten years,

07:36.560 --> 07:40.160
I'd be the one to dig it up myself.

07:45.240 --> 07:49.760
These bones have been
weighing on me ever since.

07:51.480 --> 07:52.920
I hate Yuanlongli!

07:53.640 --> 07:55.200
I hate it so much!

07:55.280 --> 07:57.600
I wish it were torn down sooner!
Just tear it down!

07:57.680 --> 08:01.240
And these bones
and all the monsters all gone!

08:01.880 --> 08:03.320
Gone for good!

08:03.840 --> 08:06.560
Then no one would care
about this case anymore!

08:07.080 --> 08:08.120
Never again.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.560
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

08:27.640 --> 08:29.400
What Qian Dajun said is mostly reliable.

08:29.920 --> 08:32.960
What he mentioned, the 1997 garage
and the rooftop incident,

08:33.039 --> 08:35.080
I did go through
those things with Uncle Ran.

08:35.159 --> 08:36.280
Preliminarily, it looks like Qian Dajun

08:36.360 --> 08:38.880
has nothing to do with Xu Meng
and her father's deaths.

08:40.559 --> 08:41.679
Qian Dajun's arrest

08:41.760 --> 08:44.680
means Yuanlongli
probably won't be demolished early.

08:45.200 --> 08:47.040
We still have time to keep investigating.

08:47.120 --> 08:51.320
Oh, and we should
circle back to Qian Dajun,

08:51.840 --> 08:54.320
question him again about
everything related to the June 30th case.

08:54.920 --> 08:57.440
Maybe it'll lead to something bigger.

08:57.520 --> 08:58.360
Okay.

09:11.040 --> 09:11.880
Uncle He.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.800
Uncle He. Good afternoon.

09:14.800 --> 09:17.200
I was just appointed by the company

09:17.280 --> 09:22.120
as the Yuanlongli project's
head of redevelopment.

09:22.640 --> 09:23.960
JIN MANLANG, RELOCATION MANAGER

09:27.520 --> 09:31.000
The company also promised
that if the demolition wraps up quickly,

09:31.840 --> 09:34.240
I'll be promoted to vice president.

09:34.760 --> 09:37.040
-So…
-So, what's that got to do with me?

09:37.640 --> 09:39.120
Uncle He,

09:39.640 --> 09:43.160
I'm not like Qian Dajun, I'm different.

09:43.680 --> 09:46.200
I believe in sincerity

09:47.040 --> 09:48.760
and peace above all.

09:53.440 --> 09:57.040
Uncle He, this place,
I'm not renting this place anymore.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.520
The rent will be returned double.

10:00.040 --> 10:01.360
Please move out.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.320
Double the rent.

10:07.600 --> 10:08.960
Wait.

10:19.720 --> 10:22.360
It's in black and white.
It's legal and valid.

10:22.440 --> 10:25.680
I paid, so I have the right to stay
for three full months.

10:25.760 --> 10:27.080
If you don't like it,

10:27.160 --> 10:29.080
you can go to court and sue me.

10:29.160 --> 10:31.120
How long it takes, I don't care.

10:32.160 --> 10:33.880
Uncle He, let's talk this over.

10:34.400 --> 10:36.000
I'll pay you triple rent.

10:38.600 --> 10:40.000
Wang Laosan, come here.

10:41.160 --> 10:43.040
Get out of here.

10:45.840 --> 10:49.000
I've worked myself
to the bone all these years

10:49.080 --> 10:52.200
and finally got my chance
to turn things around.

10:52.280 --> 10:55.000
Now, anyone who gets in my way,

10:55.080 --> 10:57.680
don't blame me, Jin Manlang,
for turning ruthless!

10:58.800 --> 11:01.920
Who was it that said "peace above all"?

11:02.720 --> 11:04.240
-Uncle He.
-See yourself out.

11:07.520 --> 11:08.360
Well…

11:12.520 --> 11:13.920
Wolf, don't get mad.

11:14.440 --> 11:15.640
Peace above all.

11:16.440 --> 11:17.640
Darn it!

11:20.880 --> 11:22.400
Wolf. Wolf!

11:25.000 --> 11:26.160
What's that?

11:26.240 --> 11:28.280
-That bag looks heavy.
-Did you see that?

11:30.400 --> 11:32.080
-That bag must be money.
-Powering on.

11:32.160 --> 11:34.920
Good news! Good news!

11:35.520 --> 11:38.320
The company has benefits for everyone!

11:38.840 --> 11:40.240
100k yuan per household,

11:40.320 --> 11:41.800
extra compensation.

11:41.880 --> 11:43.200
Just sign the contract.

11:43.280 --> 11:44.520
-Take the money now!
-Let's go!

11:44.600 --> 11:46.800
-Go take a look. Check it out.
-Take the money now!

11:46.880 --> 11:48.440
-Limited spots.
-Me first.

11:48.520 --> 11:50.920
-First come, first served!
-Me first!

11:51.000 --> 11:52.200
Is it real?

11:52.280 --> 11:53.800
-They're really paying!
-Is it real?

11:53.880 --> 11:55.480
Come on! Line up!

11:55.560 --> 11:56.960
Line up, line up!

11:57.040 --> 11:58.400
Benefits for everyone!

12:02.120 --> 12:04.040
Don't rush!

12:04.560 --> 12:07.200
One at a time! Don't rush!

12:16.920 --> 12:18.600
One at a time!

12:25.760 --> 12:28.480
Meng, you've got to hold on,

12:28.560 --> 12:30.280
stay and keep me company.

12:30.800 --> 12:33.080
Don't let a little money blind you.

12:47.960 --> 12:50.640
OFFICER HE, MENG'S BEEN DETAINED!

13:06.600 --> 13:10.080
Let Mr. Meng enjoy this

13:10.160 --> 13:13.040
Western symphony!

13:19.880 --> 13:21.120
So we're talking it out now?

13:22.200 --> 13:23.040
No more fighting?

13:27.560 --> 13:28.640
Why are you all staring at me?

13:29.480 --> 13:30.920
Keep the music going.

13:34.720 --> 13:36.080
Play something upbeat.

13:42.920 --> 13:45.080
Can't you see the door's open?

13:45.160 --> 13:46.120
Hurry up.

13:46.200 --> 13:49.280
Get Mr. Meng out here.

14:00.200 --> 14:02.840
STAGED SCENE. DO NOT IMITATE

14:04.480 --> 14:06.480
I'll send you all to hell!

14:06.560 --> 14:07.280
What are you doing?

14:07.360 --> 14:08.600
You old fool, want to die?

14:08.680 --> 14:09.920
You brat!

14:10.000 --> 14:11.520
I'll send you all to hell!

14:11.600 --> 14:13.960
That's illegal! You hear me?

14:14.040 --> 14:15.120
Call the police!

14:15.800 --> 14:17.480
Call the police now!

14:17.560 --> 14:19.040
I'll send you all to hell!

14:20.640 --> 14:21.760
Come on!

14:38.400 --> 14:41.040
Wolfie, you just won't go away.

14:50.120 --> 14:50.960
Uncle He.

14:51.640 --> 14:53.880
Qiao, what are you doing here?

14:55.200 --> 14:56.520
Come in, come in.

14:57.040 --> 14:59.200
Well, what do you want to drink?
I'll get it.

14:59.280 --> 15:00.520
Uncle He, don't bother.

15:01.600 --> 15:02.440
What's wrong?

15:04.000 --> 15:05.200
I…

15:05.280 --> 15:06.600
I didn't get our boss's approval,

15:07.680 --> 15:10.000
but I had finance sign off
on a 50k moving fee for you.

15:13.600 --> 15:14.840
Qiao, what's going on?

15:16.360 --> 15:19.600
Didn't we agree
to fulfill Ran's wish together?

15:19.680 --> 15:20.960
I know.

15:24.920 --> 15:27.600
I appreciate it, but I'm not moving.

15:28.200 --> 15:31.120
No matter the offer,
no matter the money, I won't move.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.280
That's final! You should go.

15:32.880 --> 15:35.440
Uncle He. Uncle He.

15:36.560 --> 15:39.160
Our boss has reported you to the station.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.760
You should be ready.

15:47.080 --> 15:48.360
FORENSIC REPORT

15:53.840 --> 15:56.840
Xia, Xia…

15:56.920 --> 15:59.200
Xiaohe, go to Captain Zhao's office.

15:59.280 --> 16:00.240
What's going on?

16:01.200 --> 16:04.000
Captain Zhao, we're a private company.
It's not easy.

16:04.760 --> 16:07.960
This project can't be delayed anymore.

16:08.040 --> 16:09.760
If He Yuanhang keeps this up,

16:09.840 --> 16:12.160
it won't just hurt
our company's legal rights,

16:12.240 --> 16:15.760
it'll also undermine
what the residents deserve.

16:15.840 --> 16:20.080
Your criminal department
needs to stand up for people like us!

16:20.160 --> 16:21.120
I understand.

16:21.640 --> 16:23.840
We will figure this out quickly

16:23.920 --> 16:25.200
and give you answers. Alright?

16:25.280 --> 16:26.680
Thank you, Captain Zhao.

16:26.760 --> 16:29.560
Please hurry. This can't wait.

16:29.640 --> 16:30.960
Come on. I'll walk you out.

16:31.040 --> 16:32.400
Okay, okay.

16:32.480 --> 16:33.600
-I'll head out then.
-Okay.

16:34.280 --> 16:36.200
Captain Zhao, stand up for us!

16:36.280 --> 16:38.480
-Alright.
-Okay. Take care.

16:42.320 --> 16:43.720
What's with He Yuanhang?

16:44.760 --> 16:45.960
Has he lost it again?

16:52.720 --> 16:55.600
Captain Zhao, Captain Qu,
since you're both here,

16:56.320 --> 16:57.240
I'd like to request

16:57.320 --> 16:59.640
reopening the investigation
into the June 30th case.

17:01.800 --> 17:03.360
June 30th?

17:03.440 --> 17:04.760
That's ancient history.

17:04.839 --> 17:07.560
He Xiaohe, you're just as crazy
as your dad.

17:07.640 --> 17:08.960
Isn't this mess enough?

17:10.800 --> 17:11.720
Captain Zhao,

17:13.200 --> 17:16.560
before Captain Ran passed,
he secretly reopened the June 30th case.

17:17.560 --> 17:21.119
These days, my dad and I
have been retracing his investigation.

17:21.200 --> 17:24.720
Now we have solid leads
proving Wu Shanlong was framed.

17:24.800 --> 17:26.000
The real killer is someone else.

17:29.400 --> 17:30.640
Any suspects?

17:32.440 --> 17:33.760
We are still checking.

17:36.480 --> 17:37.480
Not yet.

17:41.320 --> 17:42.200
Captain Zhao,

17:42.280 --> 17:44.760
this whole thing started because my dad

17:44.840 --> 17:47.880
found an unsent message
on Uncle Ran's old phone.

17:58.280 --> 17:59.960
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE
SAVED: 2003-01-31 13:09:37 TO: SIR

18:00.040 --> 18:01.600
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE
WAS WRONG, ALL WRONG

18:01.680 --> 18:04.360
This message was written
on the day he died.

18:07.760 --> 18:11.080
Uncle Ran died with that regret.

18:21.280 --> 18:23.720
With the leads and evidence we have,
is it enough to reopen the case?

18:24.800 --> 18:25.720
I trust my dad.

18:26.240 --> 18:27.200
Just give him more time,

18:27.280 --> 18:29.400
he'll definitely find
key clues in Yuanlongli.

18:30.120 --> 18:30.960
We have to move fast.

18:31.680 --> 18:33.800
Otherwise, we won't have the authority
to stop the legal demolition.

18:34.720 --> 18:35.760
Got it.

18:35.840 --> 18:38.400
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

18:46.520 --> 18:49.160
Tenant of 609, listen up!

18:49.920 --> 18:53.560
All residents of Yuanlongli
have moved out.

18:54.120 --> 18:56.800
Now, you're the only one left.

18:57.440 --> 19:00.040
Your landlord has already sold the place.

19:00.800 --> 19:02.720
Please leave immediately.

19:03.400 --> 19:04.360
Otherwise,

19:04.440 --> 19:07.480
the demolition team
will remove you by force.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.640
Remove you by force.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.320
HONGYUN HUIHUANG (DAHUIHUANG)

19:28.440 --> 19:29.480
JIN MANSHAN

19:29.560 --> 19:32.400
Tenant of 609, listen up!

19:32.920 --> 19:36.560
All residents of Yuanlongli
have moved out.

19:37.080 --> 19:39.840
Now, you're the only one left.

19:40.360 --> 19:43.360
Your landlord has already sold the place.

19:43.440 --> 19:46.320
Please leave immediately.

19:46.400 --> 19:47.360
Otherwise,

19:47.440 --> 19:50.920
the demolition team
will remove you by force.

19:51.000 --> 19:52.560
Remove you by force.

19:52.640 --> 19:55.000
Remove you by force.

20:30.520 --> 20:31.480
Sir.

20:46.120 --> 20:47.240
Sir,

20:48.000 --> 20:50.520
are you trying to use
the golden birdcage effect?

20:56.160 --> 20:58.800
All the monsters
in Yuanlongli are still here.

20:59.560 --> 21:03.160
As long as I keep digging,
the devil will slip up.

21:04.160 --> 21:07.480
Right now, I'll be the golden cage

21:07.560 --> 21:09.600
and lure the devil out.

21:10.600 --> 21:13.640
Then, I'll capture everything.

21:33.640 --> 21:34.600
Powering on.

21:37.640 --> 21:41.360
He, I'm giving you ten more minutes.

21:42.160 --> 21:43.360
After that,

21:44.040 --> 21:46.960
don't blame me for doing my job.

22:06.440 --> 22:07.680
DAHUIHUANG

22:08.200 --> 22:12.200
DAHUIHUANG NIGHTCLUB

22:12.280 --> 22:14.080
How did Xu Zhihong die?

22:14.160 --> 22:15.480
Where is Xu Meng?

22:15.560 --> 22:16.880
Is she dead or alive?

22:16.960 --> 22:18.840
DAHUIHUANG, JIN MANSHAN

22:18.920 --> 22:20.000
Recognize this?

22:20.080 --> 22:22.520
I really have no idea.

22:22.600 --> 22:23.400
JIN MANSHAN

22:23.480 --> 22:24.840
Pay up!

22:24.920 --> 22:26.400
Since Wu became the factory director…

22:26.480 --> 22:28.520
It shut down last month.

22:28.600 --> 22:29.640
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY
DRAGON TIGER

22:29.720 --> 22:32.040
When was the last time the father
and daughter were seen leaving home?

22:32.120 --> 22:35.240
People said it was the day
before Hong Kong, China's handover.

22:35.320 --> 22:36.280
Someone saw them leave,

22:36.960 --> 22:38.680
-and they never came back.
-Never came back.

22:39.880 --> 22:40.560
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY

22:40.640 --> 22:43.400
Back in '97, someone came
to the video rental shop

22:43.480 --> 22:45.120
to hire Wolfie to kill someone.

22:48.080 --> 22:49.680
Pattia Club.

22:49.760 --> 22:50.760
PATTIA CLUB

22:50.840 --> 22:54.480
In the end, it was all to run away
from debt collectors.

22:55.000 --> 22:56.720
PATTIA CLUB
ZHAO HONGMEI

22:56.800 --> 22:59.520
Did she meet any clients
on her last day here?

23:01.440 --> 23:02.760
I don't know.

23:02.840 --> 23:03.880
ZHAO HONGMEI, ZHANG ERSONG, SONGBENTANG

23:03.960 --> 23:05.440
A conflict is one thing,

23:05.520 --> 23:08.120
but it wouldn't escalate
to the level of murder.

23:08.200 --> 23:09.400
ZHANG ERSONG, SONGBENTANG

23:09.480 --> 23:11.040
Su Yuzhi.

23:11.120 --> 23:13.760
Are you saying Mr. Sun has something to do
with Mengmeng's disappearance?

23:13.840 --> 23:15.040
SU YUZHI

23:15.120 --> 23:16.280
Song Qingsong.

23:16.360 --> 23:17.640
About that young woman
at the foot massage shop,

23:17.720 --> 23:20.120
it's true I paid Wu Shanlong
to get rid of her.

23:20.200 --> 23:21.000
Jin Manlang.

23:21.080 --> 23:22.320
It's all chicken blood.

23:22.400 --> 23:24.920
If it's human blood,
just shoot me on the spot.

23:25.000 --> 23:27.120
JIN MANLANG, WAN QIMING

23:27.200 --> 23:29.120
In the summer of 1996,

23:29.200 --> 23:32.320
someone paid me 500 yuan
to spy on the unit opposite.

23:32.400 --> 23:33.920
I have an alibi.

23:34.000 --> 23:35.760
WAN QIMING, QIAN DAJUN

23:35.840 --> 23:36.440
GOOD NEIGHBOR TAILOR SHOP, ALTERATIONS

23:47.200 --> 23:49.040
QIAN DAJUN, YUANLONGLI ROOFTOP

23:49.120 --> 23:50.120
The rooftop.

23:57.400 --> 23:59.800
That cut was made after death,
likely during dismemberment.

24:00.640 --> 24:01.800
High probability of homicide.

24:04.840 --> 24:06.120
Qihuang Clinic.

24:06.200 --> 24:09.480
QIHUANG CLINIC

24:12.080 --> 24:12.920
Sun Zhengyong.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.680
She took her dad and left.

24:14.760 --> 24:16.960
They bought train tickets for July 1st.

24:17.040 --> 24:18.760
QIHUANG CLINIC
YUANLONGLI UNDERGROUND GARAGE

24:26.000 --> 24:27.720
YUANLONGLI UNDERGROUND GARAGE

24:27.800 --> 24:29.560
Wu Shanlong said

24:29.640 --> 24:32.480
he went and did the deed himself.

24:32.560 --> 24:33.800
HU ANPING

24:34.480 --> 24:35.600
Dajianchang.

24:35.680 --> 24:36.560
Double Fish.

24:39.680 --> 24:42.040
This dress is probably
worth more than this unit.

24:42.560 --> 24:44.080
DAJIANCHANG, XU MENG'S HOME

24:50.920 --> 24:52.720
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

24:55.360 --> 24:57.640
Is the accident investigation report
still available?

24:58.400 --> 24:59.560
Yes. It's all still here.

24:59.640 --> 25:01.280
Sir, your package.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.640
This is the Mount Wu accident file.

25:05.160 --> 25:06.440
We don't need it now.

25:08.760 --> 25:10.320
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

25:14.080 --> 25:16.040
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

25:17.960 --> 25:19.480
KIDDO

25:22.560 --> 25:25.680
Kiddo, when we first moved here,

25:26.200 --> 25:29.800
did you see a package
from Mount Wu, Kunhai?

25:30.480 --> 25:31.360
I did.

25:31.440 --> 25:33.440
At the time, it wasn't even opened,

25:34.040 --> 25:35.640
I thought it was useless,
so I didn't take it.

25:35.720 --> 25:37.920
Dad, is there a clue inside?

25:38.000 --> 25:42.040
I just reviewed all info and leads
on the June 30th case,

25:42.120 --> 25:45.560
and only the Mount Wu files
haven't been checked.

25:45.640 --> 25:48.440
MOUNT WU ACCIDENT

26:09.840 --> 26:11.520
Last minute!

26:12.560 --> 26:13.800
Fifty-nine!

26:14.640 --> 26:15.680
Fifty-eight!

26:16.560 --> 26:18.600
-Fifty--
-Bro.

26:37.240 --> 26:38.800
This is from me personally.

26:39.840 --> 26:43.840
Th-This, Wolf, you really look out for us.

26:46.440 --> 26:48.120
-Bro, H-He…
-He…

26:48.200 --> 26:49.720
-He!
-It's him!

26:54.600 --> 26:55.520
He.

26:57.560 --> 26:59.960
Finally, changed your mind?

27:04.120 --> 27:08.040
I'm telling you, stay away from my room!

27:08.560 --> 27:10.600
Or I can still lock you up!

27:11.400 --> 27:12.640
Got it, Officer He.

27:24.280 --> 27:25.360
Darn it!

27:26.800 --> 27:29.000
That old man's retired.
Why would I fear him?

27:29.080 --> 27:29.960
Biao,

27:30.480 --> 27:33.560
now you go seal off Room 609.

27:33.640 --> 27:35.200
If you can't, I'll deal with you!

27:35.280 --> 27:37.600
-Yes, sir.
-Mang, notify security,

27:37.680 --> 27:38.640
lock down New York Block,

27:38.720 --> 27:40.960
cordon it off!

27:41.040 --> 27:42.360
Not even a fly gets in!

27:42.440 --> 27:43.480
Got it, bro!

27:48.800 --> 27:49.640
Captain Liu,

27:49.720 --> 27:51.600
New York Block is cleared.

27:52.240 --> 27:54.800
Now, take your team in and inspect.

27:54.880 --> 27:56.280
Prepare the blast points!

28:39.120 --> 28:40.600
AUGUST 24TH MOUNT WU ACCIDENT REPORT

28:48.800 --> 28:51.880
LIST OF VICTIMS

28:54.320 --> 28:58.160
XU ZHIHONG, XU MENG

29:33.120 --> 29:34.160
Ran,

29:36.760 --> 29:38.520
turns out I'm not the cage.

29:40.880 --> 29:42.160
The cursed building is.

29:50.720 --> 29:51.560
Officer.

29:52.640 --> 29:54.720
Officer, where are you taking me?

29:54.800 --> 29:57.160
Move. Move.

29:57.240 --> 29:58.120
Qian Dajun.

30:03.040 --> 30:03.960
Officer He.

30:04.040 --> 30:04.800
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

30:04.880 --> 30:07.480
Have you heard
of someone in Yuanlongli named

30:07.560 --> 30:10.120
Yao Xincheng?

30:11.320 --> 30:13.160
Yao Xincheng.

30:14.040 --> 30:15.400
I know who that is.

30:17.160 --> 30:19.200
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

30:31.480 --> 30:32.800
-Officer He! Officer He!
-You're not getting up there.

30:33.560 --> 30:34.680
-Office He!
-Move!

30:35.280 --> 30:36.120
It's sealed.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.400
If you don't, I'll bite!

30:38.400 --> 30:39.240
Officer He!

30:39.320 --> 30:43.920
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

30:44.000 --> 30:46.000
You… What are you doing?

30:46.080 --> 30:47.520
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

30:47.600 --> 30:48.600
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

30:48.680 --> 30:50.080
You're paying holdouts more?

30:50.160 --> 30:51.160
What's that supposed to mean?

30:51.240 --> 30:54.520
Just because we're not holdouts
doesn't mean we're pushovers!

30:54.600 --> 30:57.720
Pay more, or I'll move back in!

30:58.720 --> 31:00.360
You… What are you doing?

31:00.440 --> 31:01.640
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

31:01.720 --> 31:02.760
DON'T LET HONEST PEOPLE LOSE OUT
EQUAL TREATMENT!

31:02.840 --> 31:07.120
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

31:07.200 --> 31:10.200
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

31:17.800 --> 31:18.800
You brat.

31:21.360 --> 31:22.480
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

31:22.560 --> 31:24.520
Everyone, calm down!

31:30.520 --> 31:32.400
Don't get worked up!

31:32.480 --> 31:36.520
I'll ask the company soon
to raise the compensation.

31:40.640 --> 31:42.640
We don't want "soon", we want it now.

31:42.720 --> 31:43.800
That's right!

31:49.280 --> 31:52.200
Everyone, stay calm!

31:52.280 --> 31:53.480
Stay calm!

31:55.800 --> 31:57.600
Why are residents
rioting at the cursed building,

31:57.680 --> 31:58.440
demanding huge compensation?

31:58.520 --> 31:59.480
With over 20 years of history,

31:59.560 --> 32:02.640
Yuanlongli, known as the cursed building,
is about to be demolished.

32:02.720 --> 32:06.120
Let's witness together
the final chapter of this legendary place.

32:06.200 --> 32:08.080
This cursed building will claim 18 lives.

32:08.160 --> 32:09.120
Two more to go.

32:09.200 --> 32:11.640
In there, isn't one still hiding?

32:11.720 --> 32:14.280
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

32:14.360 --> 32:15.240
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

32:15.320 --> 32:16.520
Where's He?

32:16.600 --> 32:23.520
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

32:29.920 --> 32:30.800
2002 YUANLONGLI OWNER/TENANT REGISTRY

32:39.680 --> 32:41.160
-Hello?
-Hello? Who is this?

32:41.240 --> 32:42.200
Hello.

32:42.720 --> 32:45.640
I'm He Yuanhang,
a retired detective from Nanshan Branch.

32:45.720 --> 32:47.600
I'd like to ask you something.

32:48.120 --> 32:49.040
Hello, Officer He.

32:49.120 --> 32:50.520
In 2002,

32:50.600 --> 32:53.040
did you buy a place in Yuanlongli?

32:53.120 --> 32:54.240
Yes.

32:54.320 --> 32:56.760
But in 2003, I sold the place.

32:57.680 --> 32:58.520
That's not right.

32:58.600 --> 33:00.960
That place is still under your name.

33:01.040 --> 33:01.880
Here's the thing.

33:01.960 --> 33:04.680
The buyer signed the agreement, paid me,

33:04.760 --> 33:06.720
and never came back
to transfer the ownership.

33:06.800 --> 33:08.840
So the owner's name is still mine.

33:09.440 --> 33:10.280
Right.

33:10.360 --> 33:13.040
Over ten years ago,
a cop also came to me about this.

33:14.160 --> 33:16.440
Was it the night
before New Year's Eve in 2003?

33:16.520 --> 33:18.480
Yes, yes. The next day was New Year's Eve.

33:19.160 --> 33:21.360
What was the buyer's name?

33:21.440 --> 33:22.280
Yao Xincheng.

33:22.880 --> 33:25.000
He had someone else handle it for him.

33:25.800 --> 33:29.200
So this proxy and the one who sold you
the place in 2002

33:29.280 --> 33:30.400
were the same person?

33:30.480 --> 33:31.920
How did you know?

33:33.000 --> 33:33.800
Pay more! Pay more!

33:33.880 --> 33:35.080
NO SERVICE

33:35.800 --> 33:39.480
He, I'm giving you my final warning!

33:40.360 --> 33:42.200
Get out right now!

33:42.280 --> 33:45.000
Otherwise, you face the consequences!

33:47.160 --> 33:50.080
Biao, go turn the power all the way up.

33:50.160 --> 33:54.040
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

33:56.040 --> 33:58.200
-What's going on?
-It's the sixth floor.

33:58.280 --> 33:59.160
The one on the sixth floor.

34:00.080 --> 34:02.200
STAGED SCENE. DO NOT IMITATE

34:19.440 --> 34:20.440
Powering on.

34:41.600 --> 34:43.360
This tune's kind of tacky.

34:43.440 --> 34:46.080
-Tacky is what gives it power.
-Yea, power.

34:46.679 --> 34:51.080
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

34:51.159 --> 34:54.080
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

34:54.159 --> 34:58.200
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

34:58.280 --> 35:03.000
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

35:03.080 --> 35:08.400
-Pay more!
-Pay more!

35:08.480 --> 35:09.720
Biao, Mang,

35:10.440 --> 35:13.720
get that old fool down here now!

35:14.600 --> 35:16.520
Stop!

35:17.040 --> 35:17.880
Jin Manlang!

35:17.960 --> 35:19.800
Stop this right now!

35:19.880 --> 35:21.200
Why should I?

35:24.520 --> 35:28.200
I've let that He guy
push me around for years.

35:28.800 --> 35:30.720
Today, he's backing down.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.800
I'm going upstairs now!

35:34.480 --> 35:36.840
If you dare, I'll call the police!

35:36.920 --> 35:37.840
Go ahead!

35:41.840 --> 35:43.600
I DEMAND JUSTICE

36:34.000 --> 36:35.720
DEMOLISH

36:47.960 --> 36:49.360
DEMOLISH

37:04.480 --> 37:05.880
HELL
